nal count: 5,099 prose words — solidly within 4,500-5,500 target\n   - Verified: 0 banned phrases, ~1.7 adverbs/page (limit: 3), proper scene breaks\n\n4. I created chapter metadata (`chapters/013/metadata.json`)\n   - Documented all craft tool applications with specific evidence from prose\n   - Scene value shifts, emotional arc, romance/fantasy beats, continuity notes, foreshadowing activity, motif appearances, prose quality metrics\n\n5. I updated all continuity tracker artifacts:\n   - `continuity/continuity-tracker.json` — Added ch13 timeline events, updated CHAR-001 and CHAR-002 positions, updated knowledge states for both characters\n   - `continuity/foreshadowing-ledger.json` — Marked FS-007 (Calwrath) as resolved, added ch13 appearance to FS-015, planted FS-019 (operation 31/Elisi) and FS-020 (kiss as irreversible threshold foreshadowing ch16 devastation)\n   - `continuity/emotional-throughline.json` — Updated ch13 entries for both characters with actualState and evidenceFromProse\n   - `continuity/information-asymmetry-map.json` — Added operation 31 fact and first kiss fact, updated Calwrath fact with CHAR-002 learning in ch13\n</history>\n\n<work_done>\nFiles created:\n- `chapters/013/draft.md` — Complete 5,099-word chapter prose with YAML frontmatter. Three scenes: camp setup/question (SCN-34), Calwrath confession (SCN-35), response and first kiss (SCN-36)\n- `chapters/013/metadata.json` — Comprehensive metadata: craft tools applied, scene value shifts, emotional arc, romance/fantasy beats, continuity notes, foreshadowing, motif appearances, prose quality metrics\n\nFiles modified:\n- `continuity/continuity-tracker.json` — Added ch13 timeline, character positions, knowledge states\n- `continuity/foreshadowing-ledger.json` — FS-007 resolved, FS-015 advanced, FS-019 and FS-020 planted\n- `continuity/emotional-throughline.json` — Ch13 entries updated with prose evidence for both characters\n- `continuity/information-asymmetry-map.json` — New facts added (operation 31, first kiss), Calwrath updated\n\nDirectories created:\n- `chapters/013/` — Chapter output directory\n- `agents/chapter-drafter/` — Status directory (created but status.json not yet written)\n\nWork completed:\n- [x] Read all 19 required upstream artifacts\n- [x] Verified ch12 draft exists (INV-012 sequential ordering)\n- [x] Drafted complete Chapter 13 prose (5,099 words, 3 scenes)\n- [x] Expanded initial draft from 4,674 to 5,099 words to hit target range\n- [x] Quality checked: 0 banned phrases, adverb density within limits\n- [x] Created comprehensive metadata.json\n- [x] Updated continuity-tracker.json\n- [x] Updated foreshadowing-ledger.json\n- [x] Updated emotional-throughline.json\n- [x] Updated information-asymmetry-map.json\n- [ ] NOT YET DONE: Write `agents/chapter-drafter/status.json`\n- [ ] NOT YET DONE: Update `manifest.json`\n- [ ] NOT YET DONE: Update `craft-tracking/symbolic-motif-registry.json` with ch13 appearances\n- [ ] NOT YET DONE: Update `craft-tracking/mystery-box-inventory.json` (currently near-empty, may not need ch13 update)\n</work_done>\n\n<technical_details>\n**Kaelith's Voice (CHAR-001 POV) — Critical Details:**\n- 70% sentences 3-8 words. Subject-verb-object. Percussive drum rhythm.\n- Structural/architectural metaphors ONLY: load-bearing, foundation, mortar, buttress, keystone, walls, curtain walls, chokepoints. NO water metaphors (Lirien's domain), NO organic/garden/dream imagery.\n- Emotions as physical events: heat in neck (anger), pressure behind sternum (grief), heat in palms (attraction), hyperawareness of exits (fear). She notices \"heat\" not \"anger.\"\n- No contractions under emotional intensity (formality = armor). Contractions slip in when relaxed.\n- Opens scenes with spatial assessment: exits, sight lines, structural weakness.\n- \"Fine\" = shield word. Pivots from emotion to tactical observation mid-sentence.\n\n**Lirien's Voice (CHAR-002 in dialogue) — Key Details:**\n- Water/current/infiltration metaphors