n\n**Style Guide Key Constraints:**\n- Banned phrases list (15 items) — verified 0 used\n- Max 3 adverbs per page, max 2 clichés per chapter\n- Show:tell ratio target 80:20 overall, 90:10 in key emotional scenes\n- Max 6 unbroken dialogue lines before beat/interruption\n- No modern slang. No therapy-speak. No purple-gothic overloading.\n- Romantic scenes: \"smoldering, restrained, and accumulative\" — desire should feel dangerous because it matters\n- Scene transitions: hard cuts on loaded image, emotional carryover\n\n**File Format Notes:**\n- Chapter drafts use YAML frontmatter: chapter, title, pov, wordCount, scenes, status\n- Chapter titles: \"Chapter Thirteen\" (word form, not numeral)\n- Scene breaks within chapters: `---`\n- JSON artifacts use camelCase keys throughout\n\n**Continuity State Post-Ch13:**\n- Both characters at granite shelf wilderness camp, northeast heading toward Quietus\n- Pre-dawn, planning to move before dawn\n- Two hunter teams remain active, observation posts on NE approach\n- Bond fully active, emotional transparency absolute\n- Oathbrand removed (ch11), phantom ache remains\n- Kaelith's magic returned but still recalibrating\n</technical_details>\n\n<important_files>\n- `chapters/013/draft.md`\n   - The primary deliverable — complete chapter 13 prose draft\n   - 5,099 words, 3 scenes (SCN-34, SCN-35, SCN-36), YAML frontmatter\n   - Key sections: Scene 1 (camp/question) lines ~12-95, Scene 2 (confession) lines ~97-180, Scene 3 (response/kiss) lines ~182-276\n\n- `chapters/013/metadata.json`\n   - Comprehensive chapter metadata documenting craft tool compliance, scene value shifts, continuity\n   - Critical for downstream agents (voice maintainer, continuity integrator, craft enforcer)\n\n- `plot/chapter-outlines/chapter-013.json`\n   - Source outline with 3 scenes, beat-by-beat allocations, emotional arc, thematic weight\n   - Referenced throughout drafting for structural compliance\n\n- `characters/CHAR-001.json`\n   - Kaelith's comple