litary-formal register maintained throughout. Key markers present: 'assessed,' 'position,' 'exits,' 'sight line,' 'perimeter,' 'defensive,' 'operational briefing,' 'reconnaissance.' No contractions in Kaelith's dialogue during emotional intensity ('I cannot undo that,' 'I do not want to undo it'). Formal register cracks precisely where intended — during the kiss, raw emotional words ('wanting,' 'desire') break through tactical framing but are immediately re-framed through threat/risk vocabulary.\\\"\\n    },\\n    \\\"sentenceRhythm\\\": {\\n      \\\"score\\\": \\\"excellent\\\",\\n      \\\"notes\\\": \\\"70%+ short declarative sentences (3-8 words) confirmed. Tactical fragments present: 'Twelve paces deep. Eight wide. Defensible.' Longer architectural sentences appear during emotional breach, subordinate clauses stacking as described in the fingerprint. Sentence length increases during the kiss passage — correctly signaling that defenses are being breached. Paragraph lengths predominantly 2-3 sentences.\\\"\\n    },\\n    \\\"metaphorDensity\\\": {\\n      \\\"score\\\": \\\"excellent\\\",\\n      \\\"notes\\\": \\\"Structural metaphors dominate throughout: 'load-bearing,' 'buttress,' 'mortar,' 'keystone,' 'foundation,' 'architecture,' 'curtain walls,' 'structural integrity,' 'ceiling losing structural integrity.' Water metaphor used once for Lirien's attention ('like water finding the place in a wall where the mortar had thinned') — appropriate per voice evolution at ch13 (Lirien's influence) and still framed through wall-integrity lens. No organic, color-based, or musical imagery in Kaelith's register (corrected 'sang' to 'cracked open').\\\"\\n    },\\n    \\\"emotionalRegister\\\": {\\n      \\\"score\\\": \\\"excellent\\\",\\n      \\\"notes\\\": \\\"Emotions consistently expressed through physical events: jaw ache, heat climbing neck, pressure behind sternum, hyperawareness of exits, hand tremor, throat closure, shoulder tension. No emotion directly named i