        "reasoning_text": "Excellent. Now I have a comprehensive view of both chapters. Let me do my systematic verification:\n\n### Ch13→Ch14 Direct Continuity Verification\n\n**Ch13 ending state:**\n- Both on granite shelf\n- Post-kiss, both remain at camp\n- Pre-dawn, intending to move before dawn\n- \"Thalen Reyvas sat in his Seventh Seat\" ✅ (7th, not 6th — consistent with DISC-001 resolution)\n- \"Two hunter teams remained in the region\"\n- Bond active, humming between them\n- Lirien's hand on Kaelith's throat (pulse point)\n\n\n- Stars filtered through Pallor's silver membrane\n\n**Ch14 opening state:**\n- Dawn light barely touching ridgeline — they've moved to dawn, consistent with \"intending to move before dawn\"\n- On the same granite shelf area: \"the rock face where their camp's ledge met the slope\" — directly matches\n- \"Kaelith was three paces ahead\" — they're moving (preparing to depart), consistent with dawn departure\n- Loose warmth carrying through predawn hours → consistent with post-kiss intimacy\n- Ambush arrives at dawn\n\n✅ Perfect continuity. Now checking physical descriptions across both chapters to verify consistency.\n\nKaelith's grey-green eyes match the character profile exactly, and her freckles across the bridge of her nose and cheekbones are described in both places. The blunt line of her dark brown hair at the jaw also aligns. For Lirien, the opalescent shimmer at her nape and wrists where the skin thins to translucence is consistent with what the profile establishes.\n\nThe contract terminology checks out too—\"cessation of heartbeat\" appears consistently across the chapter and the magic system documentation. Kaelith's forty-three completed contracts is mentioned multiple times throughout chapter 14 and matches the character profile. Now I'm looking at the reference to \"three weeks of shared sensation\" from line 110 to see how that fits into the broader consistency check. claims roughly 3 weeks since the bond formed in ch11.