5. **POV voice**: Lirien (CHAR-002) voice distinct per `characters/CHAR-002.json` — water/current metaphors allowed, contract logic patterns, precision language
6. **Emotional arc**: Escalation from ch13 appropriate? Combat-to-intimacy transition earned? Kill contract tension maintained?
